<Item XName="Text" Type="Param">
<DataEntry>Spectrasys is the broadband RF simulator behind the RF Design Kit.  &#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;- All RF parts account for reflections and reverse transmission&#x000D;&#x000A;- Nonlinear RF parts generate both even and odd order IM and &#x000D;&#x000A;      harmonic spectral products.&#x000D;&#x000A;- RF mixers include RF, LO, IF leakage terms, image effects, 2nd order &#x000D;&#x000A;    mixing products due to LO-to-IF and IF-to-LO leakage terms.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;TRY THIS: right click on any node, and plot the Power Spectrum.  Hover &#x000D;&#x000A;your mouse over the trace to see additional info stored in the plot.</DataEntry>
<TextParam><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></TextParam></Item></Item>
